    "title": "Love a Hidden Speakeasy? There are 14 Speakeasies in Minnesota - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Laura Bradshaw ,\n21 hours ago Speakeasies are fun. They are like this hidden (literally) gem where you generally can get some very unique craft cocktails, both alcoholic and non-alcoholic, along with small plate menus and shareables. Some of the fun of a speakeasy is just the getting into the speakeasy. Some places have some very creative ways to enter. Anything from a password, to a hidden door opener to some other means of gaining entrance. Read full article",
